# Aybek Ten-Bed Specialy Surgical Hospital — optional configuration
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill in only what you need.
# NEVER put a real token in this file in the repository, and never commit
# `.env.local`. `npm run check:secrets` fails if a credential is committed.
#
# The hospital needs no cloud credentials at all: it runs on the hospital
# computer with a local SQLite database and works fully offline.

# Optional: point the app at a different SQLite file
# SLOTLY_DB_PATH=/absolute/path/to/slotly.db

# Optional: secret used to sign serial licences (defaults to a constant in
# lib/hms/license.ts). Set your own on a production install, then keep it safe —
# changing it invalidates licences signed with the old value.
# AYBEK_LICENSE_SECRET=

# Optional: Next.js telemetry is already switched off by `npm run deploy`.
# Set to 0 only if you want the framework to report anonymous build data.
# NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1
